# Fixture edit.txt "abc\ndef\n". 1: typed at the start.
"Hello" SNAP
# 2: selection of two characters (Shift+LEFT).
S-LEFT S-LEFT SNAP
# 3: copy, go to the end of the row, paste.
C-c END C-v SNAP
# 4: select all and cut. 5: paste it back.
C-a C-x SNAP C-v SNAP
# 6: three undos (paste, cut, paste). 7: one more (the typing): unmodified.
C-z C-z C-z SNAP C-z SNAP
# 8: redo everything.
C-y C-y C-y C-y SNAP
# 9: BS joins lines, DEL removes forward.
C-HOME DOWN BS DEL SNAP
# 10: Enter, Tab and a word; then save.
"x" RET "\ty" C-s SNAP
# 11-12: thirty separate edits undone one by one, back to the saved text.
RET "1" RET "2" RET "3" RET "4" RET "5" RET "6" RET "7" RET "8" RET "9" RET "0"
RET "1" RET "2" RET "3" RET "4" RET "5" SNAP
C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z
C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z C-z SNAP
# 13: Shift+DOWN selects across a line end, typing replaces the selection.
C-HOME S-DOWN "Z" SNAP
C-z C-s ESC
